+- `tests/frame_tests/cases/test_37_hitstop_decoupled.gd`:
+  - Remove the long diagnostic suffix from the assert message.
+  - Keep the simple freeze/restore assertions.
+
+## Re-running the full frame tests locally (if a Godot binary is available)
