+
+## Constraints (do not regress)
+
+- Must NOT use `Engine.time_scale = 0` or `get_tree().paused = true` for hitstop (except unrelated special-move freeze `MoveSet.freeze_game`).
+- Background, particles, and UI must continue at normal speed.
+- Parameters must stay `@export` on `HitStopController`.
+- Existing frame tests 10 / 19 / 20 / 34 must keep passing.
